  "authorNotes": "KG Bangla, 13 sections = 13 syllabus rows, 100 marks. No Mohammadpur 2026 KG final exists, so the guides were MP Final 2025 KG (Q1 letter-words, Q2 opposites, Q3 sentences, Q4 fill-in, Q5 days, Q8 months, Q10 conjuncts, Q12 'Amar porichoy') and MP Half-yearly 2025 KG (Q1 missing letters, Q2 jumbled words, Q3 kar words, Q6 letter-words, Q7/Q8 flower and fish names, Q10 directions). Choices the owner may want to check: (1) Row 2 letters: used গ ট প র স from MP Final Q1 and আ from MP HY Q6; skipped MP's ঢ য় ৎ because a KG child can hardly find three words for them. (2) Row 7 '(বর্ণ)': most MP Final Q4 blanks need a letter plus a kar (লা_ম = টি, হ_ণ = রি), so only শ_র was kept; the other four are single-letter blanks taken from book pages 33 and 6. (3) Row 9: set ক = flowers, খ = fish (split 2.5 + 2.5); swap to fruits / colours / vegetables if preferred. (4) Rows 11 and 12: all names left blank for the child (MP pre-filled some), as the syllabus says all 12 months must be written. (5) Duration '২ ঘণ্টা' is taken from the MP KG paper; the Sylhet syllabus does not state one. Book page numbers are the printed page numbers of KG (Bengali) 2026."
